Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.55,0:22:38.45,ED-CN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,100)\blur5}昨天的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.95,0:22:41.45,ED-CN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,100)\blur5}大嘴巴 膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.45,0:22:44.45,ED-CN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,100)\blur5}對於所有所有這些我卻只能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:50.05,ED-CN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,100)\blur5}在虛幻的夢境裡說「差勁」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:52.95,ED-CN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,100)\blur5}隱藏在月光的陰影裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:55.50,ED-CN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,100)\blur5}其實我正在默默哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:58.35,ED-CN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(50,100)\blur5}無聲哽咽
